---
import DesignLayout from '../layouts/DesignLayout.astro';
---
<DesignLayout section="Operating System" title="Social System" focus="How does GreenSquare turn judgement into useful public authority?">
  <section class="ops-section ops-intro"><p class="ops-kicker">Publishing doctrine</p><h2>Teach judgement, not generic AI advice.</h2><p>The Social System translates GreenSquare doctrine into channel-native content that makes the reader more capable. Its job is to build authority around better judgement and convert relevant readers into Decision Frame users without diluting the underlying method.</p></section>
  <section class="ops-section"><div class="ops-heading"><span>01</span><h2>Six content pillars</h2></div><div class="ops-grid">{[['P1','Frame the real decision','Find the consequential question beneath the stated choice.'],['P2','Widen the option set','Expose false binaries and add a credible third path.'],['P3','Find the critical assumption','Name the belief that could reverse the recommendation.'],['P4','Separate evidence from belief','Distinguish GIVEN, DERIVED, INFERRED and UNKNOWN.'],['P5','Compare what matters','Make criteria, trade-offs and thresholds explicit.'],['P6','Move to action','End with an owner, timing and evidence-producing next step.']].map(([n,t,b])=><article class="ops-card"><span>{n}</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{b}</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="ops-section"><div class="ops-heading"><span>02</span><h2>Channel roles</h2></div><div class="ops-channel"><article><h3>X</h3><strong>Sharpen</strong><p>One precise idea, usually 35 to 220 characters. No hashtags by default.</p></article><article><h3>LinkedIn</h3><strong>Explain</strong><p>One complete idea with enough logic to stand alone. Usually 120 to 350 words.</p></article><article><h3>Instagram</h3><strong>Make memorable</strong><p>Five to eight slides. One visual task per slide. Designed for saves and screenshots.</p></article><article><h3>TikTok / Reels</h3><strong>Demonstrate</strong><p>Twenty to forty-five seconds. Hook fast, show the method, end with consequence.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="ops-section"><div class="ops-heading"><span>03</span><h2>Message pattern</h2></div><ol class="ops-flow">{['Observation','Reframe','Method','Consequence','Invitation'].map((x,i)=><li><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><strong>{x}</strong></li>)}</ol></section>
  <section class="ops-section ops-dark"><p class="ops-kicker">Publishing gate</p><h2>Useful, specific, coherent, then publish.</h2><ul class="ops-checks"><li>One clear idea</li><li>Decision relevance is obvious</li><li>No hype-led opening</li><li>A specific usable distinction</li><li>Evidence and assumptions are honest</li><li>All numbers are sourced</li><li>One CTA only</li><li>The reader leaves more capable</li></ul></section>
</DesignLayout>
<style>.ops-section{padding:clamp(3rem,6vw,6rem);border-top:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.65fr 1fr;gap:3rem}.ops-intro h2,.ops-dark h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4vw,4rem);line-height:1.03;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.03em}.ops-intro p:last-child{font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.65}.ops-kicker,.ops-heading span,.ops-card>span,.ops-flow span{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--design-muted)}.ops-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:4rem 1fr;margin-bottom:2.5rem}.ops-heading h2{margin:0;font-size:2.2rem}.ops-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--design-line);border-left:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-card{padding:1.5rem;border-right:1px solid var(--design-line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--design-line);min-height:13rem}.ops-card h3{margin:2rem 0 .7rem}.ops-card p,.ops-channel p{color:var(--design-muted);line-height:1.55}.ops-channel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--design-line);border:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-channel article{background:white;padding:1.5rem;min-height:13rem}.ops-channel h3{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 2rem}.ops-channel strong{display:block;margin-bottom:.7rem}.ops-flow{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;border-top:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-flow li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:4rem 1fr;padding:1.2rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-dark{background:var(--design-rail);color:white}.ops-dark .ops-kicker{color:rgba(255,255,255,.55)}.ops-checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);list-style:none;padding:0;margin:3rem 0 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)}.ops-checks li{padding:1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)}@media(max-width:850px){.ops-intro,.ops-grid,.ops-channel,.ops-checks{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>